  m_text: 'Keyboard


    WASD / Arrows - Move

    F - Fire

    E - Interact /
    advance text / confirm

    P - Pause


    Gamepad - XBOX(PS)


    Left stick
    / D-pad - Move

    X (Square) - Fire

    A (Cross) - Interact / advance text
    / confirm

    Start(Options) - Pause'
